{"seq":3,"slug":"pitfalls","title":"陷阱与评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/practice/pitfalls","wordCount":1403,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"陷阱与评估\">陷阱与评估</h1><p>代码检索最危险的失败不是「没找到」，而是「找到了一个看起来很相关、其实是错的块」。前者顶多让 agent 说不知道，后者会让它自信地基于错误上下文写出坏代码，且很难察觉。这篇是整个 hub 的收尾：盘点那些反复坑人的失败模式，并给出用可复现评估把检索质量量化、回归的方法——因为没有评估，前面所有的优化都只是凭感觉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把代码检索的失败模式归类，能看出它们各自对应前面某一章的取舍没做好。下表把典型陷阱与其根因、对策对照起来：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失败模式</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>根因</th>\n<th>对策（主讲篇）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>错块高分</td>\n<td>检出相关性假高的块</td>\n<td>嵌入模糊精确性</td>\n<td>混合检索补词法（<a href=\"../retrieval/lexical-hybrid\">词法与混合</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>切断函数</td>\n<td>块语义破碎</td>\n<td>按字符硬切</td>\n<td>AST 分块（<a href=\"../indexing/chunking-strategies\">分块策略</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>陈旧实现</td>\n<td>检出已改/已删代码</td>\n<td>索引未追新</td>\n<td>增量更新（<a href=\"freshness-incremental\">新鲜度</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨文件漏召回</td>\n<td>单块不含关键依赖</td>\n<td>一次性检索局限</td>\n<td>agentic 多轮（<a href=\"rag-over-codebase\">代码库 RAG</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>噪声塞满窗口</td>\n<td>信噪比低</td>\n<td>top-k 太大无重排</td>\n<td>重排过滤（<a href=\"../retrieval/reranking-filtering\">重排与过滤</a>）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表也是整个 hub 的索引——每一个坑都在前面有专章解。本篇的独有贡献是讲怎样把「有没有踩坑」量出来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最隐蔽的坑-错块看着很相关\">最隐蔽的坑：错块看着很相关</h2><p>值得单独展开「错块高分」这个最危险的失败模式。语义检索把代码揉进连续向量空间（见 <a href=\"../indexing/code-embeddings\">代码嵌入</a>），这个过程会把「字面相近但逻辑不同」的代码拉到相近位置——比如一个 <code>validateUserInput</code> 和一个 <code>validateUserSession</code>，名字结构相似、上下文相似，嵌入很可能给出高相似度，但它们做的是完全不同的事。</p>\n<p>后果比「漏召回」严重得多。漏召回时模型至少知道自己缺信息；而错块高分时，模型拿到一份「看起来正好相关」的上下文，会毫不怀疑地基于它推理，写出在错误前提下「正确」的代码。这是 2026 年社区反复警示「代码不要无脑上语义 RAG」的核心理由（见 <a href=\"../foundations/why-code-retrieval\">为什么需要代码检索</a>）。对策是双重的：用词法检索的精确匹配把关（见 <a href=\"../retrieval/lexical-hybrid\">词法与混合检索</a>），以及让 agent 在动手前直接读一眼真实文件确认（见 <a href=\"freshness-incremental\">新鲜度与增量更新</a> 的「直接读取做事实来源」）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"怎么评估检索质量\">怎么评估检索质量</h2><p>不评估就调优，等于蒙眼开车。代码检索评估分两层：检索本身的离线指标，和端到端的任务通过率。</p>\n<p>离线指标衡量「捞回的块对不对」，需要一个标注了「哪些块与查询真正相关」的 golden 数据集。常用三个指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Recall@</mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>top-</mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>∩</mo><mtext>相关块</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>相关块</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>MRR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>Q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>q</mi></munder><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mtext>rank</mtext><mi>q</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Recall@}k = \\frac{|\\text{top-}k \\cap \\text{相关块}|}{|\\text{相关块}|}, \\quad \\text{MRR} = \\frac{1}{|Q|}\\sum_{q} \\frac{1}{\\text{rank}_q}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Recall@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">相关块</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">top-</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∩</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">相关块</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MRR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.7076em;vertical-align:-1.3861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rank</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>nDCG@</mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>DCG@</mtext><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>IDCG@</mtext><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>DCG@</mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{nDCG@}k = \\frac{\\text{DCG@}k}{\\text{IDCG@}k}, \\quad \\text{DCG@}k = \\sum_{i=1}^{k} \\frac{2^{rel_i}-1}{\\log_2(i+1)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">nDCG@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">IDCG@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DCG@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">DCG@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5261em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Recall@k 看「相关块有没有进前 k」，关联窗口预算（见 <a href=\"../foundations/retrieval-vs-context\">检索与上下文窗口</a>）；MRR 看「第一个相关块排多前」；nDCG 综合考虑相关度与位置，是混合检索与重排最常报的指标（见 <a href=\"../retrieval/lexical-hybrid\">词法与混合检索</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[Golden 数据集&lt;br/&gt;查询+相关块标注] --&gt; B[跑检索管线]&#10;    B --&gt; C[离线指标&lt;br/&gt;Recall MRR nDCG]&#10;    A --&gt; D[跑完整 agent 任务]&#10;    D --&gt; E[端到端&lt;br/&gt;任务通过率]&#10;    C --&gt; F{指标是否提升}&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[采纳改动]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[回退]\">flowchart TD\n    A[Golden 数据集&lt;br/&gt;查询+相关块标注] --&gt; B[跑检索管线]\n    B --&gt; C[离线指标&lt;br/&gt;Recall MRR nDCG]\n    A --&gt; D[跑完整 agent 任务]\n    D --&gt; E[端到端&lt;br/&gt;任务通过率]\n    C --&gt; F{指标是否提升}\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt;|是| G[采纳改动]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[回退]</pre><h2 id=\"离线指标不够-要看端到端\">离线指标不够：要看端到端</h2><p>离线指标有个陷阱：它好不代表 agent 任务做得好。一个改动可能让 nDCG 涨了两个点，却因为引入了某种系统性噪声而让端到端任务通过率反而下降。所以代码检索的终极评估指标是<strong>端到端任务通过率</strong>——在 SWE-bench 这类基准（见 <a href=\"../foundations/why-code-retrieval\">为什么需要代码检索</a>）或你自己的内部任务集上，跑完整的 agent 流程，看它最终能解决多少真实问题。</p>\n<p>两层指标的分工可以对照如下，避免用错了尺子：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标层</th>\n<th>衡量对象</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n<th>盲区</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>离线指标</td>\n<td>捞回的块对不对</td>\n<td>快速筛选组件改动</td>\n<td>好指标≠agent 做得好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>端到端通过率</td>\n<td>真实任务成功率</td>\n<td>最终拍板</td>\n<td>慢、贵、样本量受限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>离线指标的盲区正是端到端存在的原因：它测的是「检索层」，而 agent 的最终产出还会受上下文组织、提示、多轮策略影响。两者必须同时建。</p>\n<p>实践建议是两层都建：离线指标用于快速迭代检索组件（改了分块、换了重排器，先看离线指标筛掉明显变差的），端到端通过率用于最终拍板（离线看好的改动，要用端到端确认它真的帮到 agent）。把这套评估接入 CI，每次改动都跑回归，才能避免「优化了半天某个指标、agent 却变笨了」。这也是 <a href=\"rag-over-codebase\">代码库 RAG</a> 末尾强调的——决定成败的不是选了哪个组件，而是有没有持续评估在守门。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>代码检索最危险的不是漏召回，而是「错块高分」——模型基于看似相关的错块自信写出坏代码。</li>\n<li>主要失败模式（错块、切断函数、陈旧、跨文件漏召回、噪声塞窗）各对应前面某章的取舍，本表即全 hub 索引。</li>\n<li>离线评估需 golden 数据集，用 Recall@k、MRR、nDCG@k 衡量检索质量，nDCG 最常用于混合与重排。</li>\n<li>离线指标好不等于 agent 做得好，终极指标是 SWE-bench 式的端到端任务通过率。</li>\n<li>两层评估都建并接入 CI 回归：离线快速筛选、端到端最终拍板，是检索基础设施长期可靠的守门人。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"陷阱与评估","id":"陷阱与评估"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"最隐蔽的坑：错块看着很相关","id":"最隐蔽的坑-错块看着很相关"},{"level":2,"text":"怎么评估检索质量","id":"怎么评估检索质量"},{"level":2,"text":"离线指标不够：要看端到端","id":"离线指标不够-要看端到端"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"新鲜度与增量更新","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/code-retrieval-indexing/practice/freshness-incremental"},"next":null}